1002	## Language — MANDATORY
1003	
1004	**Your `description:` and your `fix:` sentence are written in Simplified Technical English.** The
1005	rules follow these ones in your bundle, under the heading "Report language". Read them, and
1006	obey them in every finding and every lead you emit.
1007	
1008	Your `description:` is what the report prints. Nothing downstream rewrites it into plain
1009	English for you — the orchestrator pastes it into the report and the report goes to the
1010	developer who must fix the code. One sentence, twenty-five words or fewer, active voice, no
